Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Show who awarded points, add Recent Points (2-week
 cycle), fix strength input

- point_transactions already tracked awarded_by; now shown in Profile points history and Points page's Recent Awards feed
- Add get_user_recent_points RPC + client-side getCurrentPointsCycleStart/getNextPointsResetDate helpers, anchored to Friday 2026-09-18, repeating every 14 days
- Dashboard, Profile, and Members modal now show both Total Points and Recent Points
- Damage Calculator strength input no longer forces back to 0 while typing/clearing the field
